title: $:/mf/gen/Panel/help panel
catalog: Panel
target: help panel
summary: The help panel type

!! Commands

* ``help:apply`` — Help: search for the box text, leaving the box (stay: keep the focus)
* ``help:back`` — Help: back to the page shown before
* ``help:clear`` — Help: empty the search box and focus it (stay: leave the focus)
* ``help:focus`` — Help: focus the search box
* ``help:forward`` — Help: forward again, after going back
* ``help:open-hints`` — Help: label the links in view with letters; typing a label follows it

!! Generic commands

Provides ``index``, ``count``, ``select``, ``descend``, ``parent`` to [[Generic panel commands]].
